commit a703e3795ea849b6e3b45dd82d066a992b8c0b1f

C03: the which-alarm clarification must ask which alarm, never propose one (AGENDA1339)

AGENDA1337 measured: «cancelame la alarma» produced «¿Quieres que cancele la alarma más reciente?», a candidate the product never read. formulate_explicit_clarification_question now checks a which_alarm question: it must ask which one (cuál / which alarm) and must not name a candidate (más reciente, última, latest, first…); one corrected retry, then failure.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


